    "description": {
      "value": "<h2>Bouquet of Roses</h2><p>A deceptive floral weapon with thorns, petals, and a flexible stem.</p><p><strong>Rose Strike:</strong> 1d6 piercing.</p><p><strong>Thorn Scatter:</strong> 2d6 piercing in a short burst/cone; DEX save for half (area placement handled manually).</p><p><strong>Petal Feint:</strong> Bonus Action; the next Bouquet attack before the end of the turn has Advantage.</p><p><strong>Stem Lash:</strong> 1d8 slashing with reach; on hit, may pull the target 5 ft.</p>",
      "chat": "<p></p>"
